stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SAFE_IDLE
  SAFE_IDLE --> CAPTURE : intake authorized
  CAPTURE --> SORT : solids retained
  SORT --> PRETREAT : polymer confidence above threshold
  SORT --> SECURED_REJECT : uncertain / mixed / fouled
  PRETREAT --> REACTOR_READY : boundary checks pass
  REACTOR_READY --> REACTING : closed valves and sensors healthy
  REACTING --> ANALYZE : scheduled sample
  ANALYZE --> RECOVER : products identified and particles absent
  ANALYZE --> RECYCLE : unknown product or polymer remains
  RECYCLE --> ANALYZE : repeat bounded cycle
  RECOVER --> SAFE_IDLE : purge and inspection pass
  REACTING --> FAIL_CLOSED : leak, pressure, particle or sensor fault
  PRETREAT --> FAIL_CLOSED : containment fault
  FAIL_CLOSED --> SECURED_REJECT : isolate and retain
  SECURED_REJECT --> SAFE_IDLE : documented recovery

